msgstr "Tus libretas"

#: src/strings.ts:961
msgid "Your notes"
msgstr "Tus notas"

#: src/strings.ts:2059
msgid "Your password is always hashed before leaving this device."
msgstr "Tu contraseña siempre se cifra antes de salir de este dispositivo."

#: src/strings.ts:842
msgid "Your privacy matters to us, no matter who you are. In a world where everyone is trying to spy on you, Epigrapho encrypts all your data before it leaves your device. With Epigrapho no one can ever sell your data again."
msgstr "Tu privacidad nos importa, seas quien seas. En un mundo donde todos quieren espiarte, Epigrapho cifra todos tus datos antes de que salgan de tu dispositivo. Con Epigrapho nadie puede volver a vender tus datos."

#: src/strings.ts:1315
msgid "Your profile pictrure is stored 100% end-to-end encrypted and only visible to you."
msgstr "Tu foto de perfil se guarda 100% cifrada de extremo a extremo y solo tú la ves."

